{"type":"word_bank","difficulty":"intermediate","question":"A sinking fund sets aside money before a predictable _____ arrives.","options":["expense","profit","discount","salary"],"answer":["expense"],"explanation":"Saving gradually for annual fees or repairs prevents a predictable bill from becoming emergency debt.","locales":{"id":{"type":"word_bank","difficulty":"intermediate","question":"Sinking fund menyisihkan uang sebelum _____ yang sudah diperkirakan datang.","options":["pengeluaran","keuntungan","diskon","gaji"],"answer":["pengeluaran"],"explanation":"Menabung bertahap untuk biaya tahunan atau perbaikan mencegah tagihan rutin berubah menjadi utang darurat."}}
